#: template-parts/front/about.php:32
msgid "I'm a software developer who began my career in 2011 as an engineer and have since specialized as a fullstack developer with strong expertise in PHP, C#, React, React Native, and Angular."
msgstr "Sou desenvolvedor de software: comecei a carreira em 2011 como engenheiro e, desde então, me especializei como desenvolvedor fullstack, com forte domínio de PHP, C#, React, React Native e Angular."

#: template-parts/front/about.php:35
msgid "I have designed and implemented scalable web and mobile applications, built robust back-end architectures, and crafted intuitive front-end experiences. My work spans projects such as internal CRM systems (including commercial modules and invoicing), commercial and logistics solutions for the food industry, and web platforms for the property and training sectors."
msgstr "Projetei e implementei aplicações web e mobile escaláveis, construí arquiteturas back-end robustas e criei experiências front-end intuitivas. Meu trabalho inclui sistemas de CRM internos (com módulos comerciais e de faturamento), soluções comerciais e logísticas para a indústria alimentícia e plataformas web para os setores imobiliário e de treinamento."

